OL,3,GNEWSABurnham says he will adjust triple
OL,4,Alock pension from April 2030 to help
OL,5,Afund new social care service
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham says the government will
OL,8,Fchange the pensions "triple lock" from
OL,9,F2030 - watch his speech to the Labour
OL,10,FParty conference live at the top of the
OL,11,Fpage
OL,13,FThe triple lock means the state pension
OL,14,Fincreases annually by inflation,
OL,15,Faverage wage growth, or 2.5% -
OL,16,Fwhichever is highest
OL,18,FBut Burnham says that, from April 2030,
OL,19,Fit will "rise at least by prices
OL,20,F[inflation] or 2.5%" and will "hold its
OL,21,Fvalue relative to earnings over time"
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
