OL,3,GNEWSABurnham says he will adjust triple
OL,4,Alock pension from April 2030 to help
OL,5,Afund new social care service
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn housing, Burnham pledges to reform
OL,8,Fthe leasehold system, telling
OL,9,Fleaseholders "the days of you being
OL,10,Fsqueezed for every penny are coming to
OL,11,Fan end"
OL,13,FOn water, he says the government will
OL,14,Fend "Margaret Thatcher's ideological
OL,15,Fban" on public ownership of water
OL,16,Fcompanies
OL,18,FAnd on a "national care service", he
OL,19,Fpledges a system where "everyone
OL,20,Fcontributes, and everyone is covered -
OL,21,Ffree at the point of use"
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
